(7703083, 1264722, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like this, almost gave it a 9, but it seems oversharpened, which doesn''t fit the scene. Especially the tree on the left. The right side is much more comfortable in it''s softness. If you had toned it down on the left, I think it would have been fascinating.</td>', 'I really like this, almost gave it a 9, but it seems oversharpened, which doesn''t fit the scene. Especially the tree on the left. The right side is much more comfortable in it''s softness. If you had toned it down on the left, I think it would have been fascinating.', '2021-10-10 19:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703084, 1264710, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is tilted at such an angle, it''s disconcerting, but not in a positive way. Beautiful scene, lovely long exposure, but water doesn''t fall to the side like that. :(</td>', 'This is tilted at such an angle, it''s disconcerting, but not in a positive way. Beautiful scene, lovely long exposure, but water doesn''t fall to the side like that. :(', '2021-10-10 19:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
