(7703148, 1264723, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture, Sara.  The phrase "folding lines" comes to me for some reason and I always find dry stone walls evocative but the height of these is really impressive.</td>', 'Lovely capture, Sara.  The phrase "folding lines" comes to me for some reason and I always find dry stone walls evocative but the height of these is really impressive.', '2021-10-11 14:03:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7703153, 1264735, 173844, '<td valign="top">Didn''t comment on the challenge, but had this as my favorite, the 9.  This result surprised me, as I usually default to wilderness scenes, of which there are several fine ones here.  But the movement, the depth, the mosaic complexity and the fabulous cloud-filled sky mesmerized me.  It''s good to see that an attentive eye can find gold in the seemingly mundane.  Under-rated.</td>', 'Didn''t comment on the challenge, but had this as my favorite, the 9.  This result surprised me, as I usually default to wilderness scenes, of which there are several fine ones here.  But the movement, the depth, the mosaic complexity and the fabulous cloud-filled sky mesmerized me.  It''s good to see that an attentive eye can find gold in the seemingly mundane.  Under-rated.', '2021-10-11 16:20:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7703154, 1264744, 173844, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t make up my mind about a 5 or an 8, so forgot to vote.  The landscape aspect here is kind of evasive, but the framing and the the bright patch of trees, with its textures, colors, lines and charming harmony are quite compelling.  So, despite the votes, deserving of enjoyment and appreciation.  Hope I wouldn''t have copped out to a 6, but forged ahead with my initial impression.</td>', 'Couldn''t make up my mind about a 5 or an 8, so forgot to vote.  The landscape aspect here is kind of evasive, but the framing and the the bright patch of trees, with its textures, colors, lines and charming harmony are quite compelling.  So, despite the votes, deserving of enjoyment and appreciation.  Hope I wouldn''t have copped out to a 6, but forged ahead with my initial impression.', '2021-10-11 16:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
